  "notes": "Splits AO3 tag-like text into four independent editable groups: Warnings, Categories, Relationships, and Additional Tags. Results/Browse now shows each on its own tag line, and Inside-a-Fic metadata renders those values as tag links too. The first mock work uses The Midnight Visitor with Thomas Thorn/Oisín. Each group has separate font/color/size/glow settings and its own Gradient Studio target, while existing Tags settings migrate forward as Additional Tags. Gradient export selectors are separated so one tag type no longer recolors every other tag type."
